Z||000005||Mark Matthews||12-04-2001||07:24 PM||||A speaker in one door and not the other?  I'm thinking owner install.  Why would you have 1 speaker?  Odd...||||reg||13
Z||000006||mbramble||12-04-2001||09:37 PM||||If it's a speaker in either or both doors, it is an owner install.  Fieros had no speakers in the doors from the factory.||||reg||1
